Package: immunoPlex
Title: Statistical Analysis of Multiplex Cytokine Data with Censoring
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuanyuan", "Wang", , "yyw451@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides comprehensive statistical methods for analyzing multiplex
    cytokine expression data with limit-of-detection (LOD) censoring. Supports
    Gamma GLMM, Tobit, accelerated failure time (AFT), and Gaussian glmmTMB
    models with automated model selection, preprocessing utilities, and
    diagnostic plotting. Additionally supports PLS-DA analysis for multivariate
    cytokine pattern discovery.
